\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.14}{\ignorespaces Overview of a key-value memory layer. The input is projected into a query, compared to the memory keys, and only the values associated with the selected keys are used for computation. Figure from \citet {lample2019largememorylayersproduct}.}}{37}{figure.caption.28}%
